  { "key": "gallery.intro.body", "page": "gallery", "label": "Intro · paragraph", "type": "multiline", "sort": 11, "value": "A look around our two acres in Liberty Hill, Texas — the ceremony lawn and floral arch, the 2,600 sq ft indoor reception hall, the string-lit outdoor terrace, the private bridal suite, and the golden-hour light our couples come back for. Filter by ceremony, reception, outdoor spaces or details, and tap any photo to enlarge." },
